@startuml
title Autorización por Roles
actor Admin
actor Usuario
participant Frontend
participant JwtAuthenticationFilter
participant SecurityConfig
participant Controller

Admin -> Frontend : Acción administrativa
Frontend -> JwtAuthenticationFilter : Authorization Bearer JWT
JwtAuthenticationFilter -> SecurityConfig : Autenticación y roles
SecurityConfig -> Controller : Permite ROLE_ADMIN

Usuario -> Frontend : Intenta endpoint admin
Frontend -> JwtAuthenticationFilter : Authorization Bearer JWT
JwtAuthenticationFilter -> SecurityConfig : ROLE_USER
SecurityConfig --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden
@enduml
